    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Continuing with the next place values:\n   - 8 + 5 = 13. We write down 3 and carry over 1 to the thousands place.\n   - So, in the thousands place, we have 1 + 3 + 1 (carried over) = 5.\n   - Therefore, we write down 5 in the thousands place of the sum.\n8. Moving to the ten-thousands place:\n   - 3 + 5 = 8\n   - So, we write down 8 in the ten-thousands place of the sum.\n9. Finally, the hundred-thousands place:\n   - 8 + 7 = 15. We write down 5 and carry over 1 to the million place.\n   - So, in the million place, we have 1 (carried over) + 0 = 1.\n   - Therefore, we write down 1 in the million place of the sum.\n10. Putting it all together, the sum is:\n    ```\n    838221\n    +753223\n    ------\n    1591044\n    ```\n11. To verify, we can add the numbers again:\n    ```\n    838221\n    +753223\n    ------\n    1591044\n    ```\n    The sum is indeed 1591044.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe sum of 838221 and 753223 is 1591044.\n</answer>",
